{"id":"1b6dc3fc-a168-5ede-8cd2-fb3e22566de4","title":"开发自定义组件","icon":"🧪","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"开发自定义组件","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"React 组件包","title":"把缺少的交互写成组件","lead":"内置组件和模板表达不了你要的关系或交互时，写一个 React 组件包：它在沙箱中运行，按精确版本被引用，可随 HTML 离线交付。","facts":[{"label":"必需文件","value":"manifest · schema · 入口"},{"label":"文档契约","value":"documentation v2"},{"label":"可导入","value":"react · showai:components"},{"label":"版本","value":"一经导入不可变"}],"art":"dev"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-40ab5cfb"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-3fab5b68"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件包的结构"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下面是一个真实组件包。点选文件和字段查看要求与示例值。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-42ab6021"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"name":"showcase-mortgage-answer","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"一个组件包就是一个文件夹。目录名不重要，ID 和版本写在 manifest.json 里。","detail":"这里用仓库中的真实示例 `design/showcase/demos/intro-mortgage/components/showcase-mortgage-answer/`：一个对比等额本息与等额本金的交互回答。","children":[{"name":"manifest.json","kind":"file","badge":"必需","open":true,"summary":"身份、说明、默认数据、示例和文档。","detail":"新组件需要 `id`、`name`、`version`、`description`、`scenarios`、`entry`、`defaultData`、`examples` 和 `documentation`。默认数据和每个示例都必须通过 schema 校验。文档属于不可变源码，计入指纹。","children":[{"name":"id","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"小写字母、数字和连字符。","example":"\"showcase-mortgage-answer\"","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"version","kind":"field","type":"semver","summary":"精确版本。改了任何内容就换新版本号。","example":"\"1.0.0\"","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"name · description","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"在目录中显示的名称与一句话说明。"},{"name":"category","kind":"field","type":"可选","summary":"目录分类：`text`、`image`、`table`、`data`、`flow`、`surface` 或 `other`。"},{"name":"scenarios","kind":"array","type":"string[]","summary":"适用场景，帮助 Agent 和用户选择组件。","example":"[\"介绍页展示回答怎样变成可探索的内容\", \"解释等额本息与等额本金的差别\"]","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"entry","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"React 入口文件。","example":"\"index.tsx\"","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"reader","kind":"field","type":"\"readData\"","badge":"可选","summary":"声明入口导出了同步的 `readData(props)`。","detail":"返回不超过 64 KiB 的 JSON，只在组件的浏览器沙箱中执行，不能读文件或调用服务。Agent 读取页面时能拿到这些派生值。"},{"name":"defaultData","kind":"object","type":"props","summary":"插入组件时的初始数据。","example":"{\n  \"principal\": 1000000,\n  \"ratePct\": 3.1,\n  \"years\": 30,\n  \"textAnswer\": \"…\",\n  \"exploreLead\": \"…\"\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"examples","kind":"array","type":"{name, data}[]","summary":"命名的完整示例，可附 `request` 与 `description`。"},{"name":"dependencies","kind":"array","type":"引用[]","badge":"可选","summary":"嵌套使用的子组件的精确版本与指纹。"},{"name":"documentation","kind":"object","type":"version 2","badge":"新组件必需","summary":"使用与开发契约：`reuse`、`usage`、`development`。","detail":"`reuse.kind` 为 general、domain 或 content-specific（后者需写 `owner`）。`usage` 写目的、结构、输入含义、配方、交互与持久化、约束和编辑边界；`development` 写入口、架构、扩展点、不变量和验证方法。完整结构用 `showai guide component --json` 查看。","children":[{"name":"usage.inputs","kind":"array","type":"参数说明[]","summary":"每个参数的含义、单位、省略行为。","example":"{\"path\": \"principal\", \"meaning\": \"初始贷款金额。\", \"units\": \"元\"}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"usage.interactions","kind":"array","type":"交互[]","summary":"动作、效果与持久化：`view`、`content`、`mixed` 或 `none`。","example":"{\n  \"action\": \"拖动贷款金额、年利率或切换年限\",\n  \"effect\": \"重新计算两种还款计划、交叉点和利息差。\",\n  \"persistence\": \"view\"\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"usage.rules","kind":"array","type":"关系规则[]","badge":"可选","summary":"`unique`、`reference`、`index`、`sumMaximum` 四种关系校验。"},{"name":"development.verification","kind":"array","type":"string[]","summary":"可复核的验证要点。","example":"[\"在 1000 px 与 375 px 宽度检查切换、滑块和逐期读数。\"]","exampleLang":"json"}]}]},{"name":"props.schema.json","kind":"file","badge":"必需","summary":"属性的 JSON Schema，页面写入时据此校验。","detail":"建议写严格的 `additionalProperties: false`。`format` 目前只作注释，不做校验；`default` 不会自动填入数据。","example":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"principal\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 100000,\n      \"maximum\": 10000000\n    },\n    \"years\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"enum\": [10, 15, 20, 25, 30]}\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"principal\", \"years\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"index.tsx","kind":"file","badge":"入口","summary":"默认导出 React 组件，接收 `{ data, onChange, readOnly }`。","detail":"可以导入 `react`、包内文件和 `showai:components`（内置组件的 React 实现）；子组件从 `showai:component/<id>` 导入。其他 npm 包会被编译器拒绝。"},{"name":"style.css","kind":"file","badge":"可选","summary":"包内样式，由入口文件导入。图片和字体也可以随包携带。"}]}],"initial":"showcase-mortgage-answer/manifest.json","caption":"示例来自仓库 design/showcase 中的房贷对比组件。"},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-41ab5e8e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-44ab6347"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"入口组件怎么写"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"入口默认导出一个 React 组件。"},{"type":"text","text":"data","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 是页面中保存的属性；编辑模式下调用 "},{"type":"text","text":"onChange(next)","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 保存修改，阅读模式（"},{"type":"text","text":"readOnly","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"）下持久修改被禁用，但本地 state 仍可用于临时探索。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-43ab61b4"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"tsx","id":"node-46ab666d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"import React, { useState } from 'react';\nimport './style.css';\n\ntype Data = { label: string; value: number; min: number; max: number };\n\nexport default function ValueSlider({ data, onChange, readOnly }: {\n  data: Data; onChange?: (next: Data) => void; readOnly: boolean;\n}) {\n  // 阅读时只改本地状态；编辑时通过 onChange 交回新数据\n  const [value, setValue] = useState(data.value);\n  return (\n    <label className=\"vs\">\n      {data.label}：{value}\n      <input type=\"range\" min={data.min} max={data.max} value={value}\n        onChange={(e) => {\n          const next = Number(e.target.value);\n          setValue(next);\n          if (!readOnly) onChange?.({ ...data, value: next });\n        }} />\n    </label>\n  );\n}\n\n// 可选：manifest.reader = \"readData\" 时，Agent 能读到派生值\nexport function readData(data: Data) {\n  return { share: (data.value - data.min) / (data.max - data.min), derived: true };\n}"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"沙箱","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：桌面和普通 HTML 中，组件运行在 "},{"type":"text","text":"sandbox=\"allow-scripts\"","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 的 iframe 里，不能访问桌面桥接、文件系统或外部网络；图片和字体需要随包携带或内嵌。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-181f20c2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5953114d"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"手势","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：需要自己处理拖动或缩放的组件，可以从 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai:components","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 导入 "},{"type":"text","text":"GestureBoundary","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，只声明真正需要的轴（"},{"type":"text","text":"x","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"y","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"zoom","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"）。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3ca8b1ad"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-58530fba"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"会话内显示","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：inline 导出使用单独编译的挂载代码，在宿主页面中用 Shadow DOM 隔离样式；此时组件脚本共享宿主的执行环境。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c1d0aa78"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-57530e27"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-45ab64da"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"组合内置组件与子组件","open":false,"id":"node-38ab5063"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai:components","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 可以命名导入 "},{"type":"text","text":"RichText","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Image","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Table","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Toggle","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Chart","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Database","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Metrics","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Playground","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Gallery","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Bookmark","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Video","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"Audio","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"PDF","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"References","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 等内置实现，以及 "},{"type":"text","text":"Flowchart","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bb200dfc"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"要复用另一个自定义组件，先在 "},{"type":"text","text":"manifest.dependencies","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 中声明它的精确版本与指纹，再从 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai:component/<id>","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 导入。父组件的离线运行代码包含所有子组件；嵌套最多 16 层、100 个包。把 "},{"type":"text","text":"data","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"readOnly","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","text":"onChange","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 传给每个子组件。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bc200f8f"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-37ab4ed0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"从创建到使用"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"先查目录","body":"多数需求可以用现有组件组合完成。只有复用和组合都缺少某种表达或交互时，才值得新写组件。","code":"showai catalog list --kind component --project PROJECT --json\nshowai catalog describe chart --view guide --project PROJECT --json"},{"title":"写组件包","body":"准备 `manifest.json`、`props.schema.json` 和 React 入口。可以从内置组件的源码开始：`--view source` 读出后改用新的 id 和版本。","code":"showai catalog describe metrics --view source --file '*' --out metrics-source.json --project PROJECT --json"},{"title":"导入到项目","body":"编译、校验 schema 与示例后保存为项目中的新版本。已存在的版本不能被覆盖。","variants":[{"label":"CLI","code":"showai catalog import --project PROJECT --input ./value-slider --json"},{"label":"MCP","code":"component_import { \"projectId\": \"PROJECT\", \"directory\": \"/abs/path/value-slider\" }"}],"result":"返回组件的 `version` 与 `integrity`，页面引用会锁定这两个值。"},{"title":"放进页面","body":"在工作台的组件目录里插入，或让 Agent 用区块操作插入。","code":"[{ \"type\": \"component.insert\", \"kind\": \"custom\",\n   \"data\": { \"componentId\": \"value-slider\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n             \"props\": { \"label\": \"数值\", \"value\": 30, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 100 } } }]","lang":"json","note":"用 `pages apply PAGE --input ops.json --base-hash HASH --base-revision REV` 提交。"},{"title":"检查真实渲染","body":"截图看样式与窄屏，交互用 html 视图检查；再导出 HTML 确认离线可用。","code":"showai pages read PAGE --project PROJECT --view image --width 1000 --out shot.png --json\nshowai pages read PAGE --project PROJECT --view image --width 390 --out narrow.png --json\nshowai export --project PROJECT --page PAGE --format html --out ./preview.html --json"},{"title":"修改后发布新版本","body":"改动 `version`（如 1.0.1）后重新导入，再把页面中的引用换到新版本。旧页面继续使用旧版本，不受影响。","result":"目录中同时保留两个版本，各自有独立的指纹。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-92c0cb88"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🧠","tone":"sage","id":"node-93c0cd1b"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Agent 中开发组件时，ShowAI 插件的 "},{"type":"text","text":"create-component","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 技能会按这个流程引导，见"},{"type":"text","text":"技能与工作流程","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/skills"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-de470b84"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-94c0ceae"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"参数文档与渐进查询"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"参数只有一个事实来源："},{"type":"text","text":"props.schema.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 定义结构，"},{"type":"text","text":"documentation.usage.inputs","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 说明含义和省略行为，"},{"type":"text","text":"defaultData","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 与 "},{"type":"text","text":"examples","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 提供真实样例。ShowAI 从这三处生成参数参考，不需要再手写一张参数表。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-95c0d041"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"路径支持点号与 "},{"type":"text","text":"[]","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（如 "},{"type":"text","text":"slides[].regions[].box","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"），也支持带 "},{"type":"text","text":"*","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 通配的 JSON Pointer。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5599685c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8f1da4c3"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可选或条件字段要写明省略行为："},{"type":"text","text":"reject","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（拒绝）、"},{"type":"text","text":"omit","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（不出现）或 "},{"type":"text","text":"fallback","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"（回退到一个值、首个/末个来源字段，或由其他输入计算）。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7a22f947"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8e1da330"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"关系规则 "},{"type":"text","text":"unique","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"reference","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"index","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"sumMaximum","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 会在示例校验、页面写入和离线组件中用同一个函数执行。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2aa9e0a6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-911da7e9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-96c0d1d4"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json","id":"node-97c0d367"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"path\": \"initialSlide\",\n  \"meaning\": \"初始选中的幻灯片 ID。\",\n  \"omission\": {\n    \"behavior\": \"fallback\",\n    \"description\": \"省略时选中第一张幻灯片。\",\n    \"from\": {\"path\": \"slides[].id\", \"selection\": \"first\"}\n  }\n}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 不需要一次读完整个 schema，可以按字段和分页读取。每页默认 20 项、最多 50 项，"},{"type":"text","text":"knownHash","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 可以跳过已读过的相同内容。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-98c0d4fa"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-99c0d68d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"showai catalog describe COMPONENT --view parameters --project PROJECT \\\n  --parameter-path 'slides[].regions[].box' --parameter-limit 20 --json"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"⚠️","tone":"sand","id":"node-8ac0bef0"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"校验通过只说明 schema 与文档一致、声明的关系成立。渲染器是否真的按文档回退、读者能否看懂，仍要在真实页面中检查。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8bc2db07"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-8bc0c083"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"版本、派生与解析"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件按作用域保存。同一作用域中，"},{"type":"text","text":"id + version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 只对应一份内容；页面引用锁定 "},{"type":"text","text":"kind","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"id","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","text":"integrity","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 四个字段。点选节点了解每一步用到的命令。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4c83ac3"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"id":"builtin","label":"内置组件","sub":"随应用发布","col":0,"row":0,"tone":"slate","detail":"提供可编辑的起始源码：`catalog describe ID --view source` 读出，换新 id 与版本后保存到项目。"},{"id":"folder","label":"组件包文件夹","sub":"本地源码","col":0,"row":1,"tone":"slate","detail":"你在本地编写的源码。"},{"id":"project","label":"项目版本","sub":"scope: project","col":1,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"所有创作都发生在明确指定的项目里。写入必须带 `projectId`，不会退回全局。当前项目的版本也不会自动出现在其他项目中。"},{"id":"page","label":"页面引用","sub":"锁定版本与指纹","col":2,"row":1,"tone":"teal","detail":"保存页面前会校验属性、补齐版本与指纹并锁定。后续发布新版本不会改变已有页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format"},{"id":"global","label":"全局版本","sub":"scope: global","col":2,"row":0,"tone":"violet","detail":"显式注册：`catalog promote --to global`，会复制完整的依赖闭包。只能通过 CLI 或桌面操作完成，绑定项目的 MCP 不能写全局。"},{"id":"other","label":"其他项目","sub":"派生版本","col":3,"row":0,"tone":"brand","detail":"`catalog fork` / `catalog_fork` 把选定版本派生到指定项目，需要新版本号或新名称，并记录来源 `parents`。"},{"id":"prepared","label":"发布文件","sub":"publish prepare","col":1,"row":2,"tone":"warm","detail":"生成 `manifest.json` 与包含精确闭包的包文件，路径中带内容摘要。只在本地生成，不上传。"},{"id":"host","label":"你的静态托管","col":2,"row":2,"tone":"slate","detail":"上传由你自己选择的渠道完成，是单独的一步。"},{"id":"published","label":"已发布版本","sub":"scope: published","col":3,"row":2,"tone":"rose","detail":"`publish verify --url MANIFEST_URL` 从实际网址取回清单和包，核对字节数、摘要、指纹与依赖，全部通过后才登记。"}],"edges":[{"from":"builtin","to":"project","label":"改源码另存"},{"from":"folder","to":"project","label":"导入"},{"from":"project","to":"page","label":"锁定引用"},{"from":"project","to":"global","label":"注册全局"},{"from":"global","to":"other","label":"派生"},{"from":"project","to":"prepared"},{"from":"prepared","to":"host","label":"自行上传","dashed":true},{"from":"host","to":"published","label":"校验登记"},{"from":"published","to":"other","label":"派生"}],"initial":"project","caption":"查找顺序：项目 → 全局 → 已发布，内置兜底。显式带指纹的引用只解析到指纹相符的版本。"},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-3c83930"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两条修改线要汇合时，用三方合并："},{"type":"text","text":"catalog merge preview","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 只预览、不写入，冲突处保留双方内容；确认后用 "},{"type":"text","text":"catalog merge resolve","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 以新版本号保存，记录 "},{"type":"text","text":"parents","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 与 "},{"type":"text","text":"mergeBase","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6c83de9"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-5c83c56"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"showai catalog fork --project PROJECT --input ref.json --id my-variant --version 1.0.0 --json\nshowai catalog merge preview --project PROJECT --input merge-input.json --out merge-preview.json --json\nshowai catalog merge resolve --project PROJECT --input resolved-merge.json --json"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-8c8410f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"把组件放进模板"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"模板是一个文件夹：带 JSON 头信息的 "},{"type":"text","text":"README.md","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、六个阶段的指南、可选的组件库和